# LEGACY / OPTIONAL: the dashboard now stores credentials encrypted (OS
# keychain via `keyring`) in an "environment" -- see README "Environments".
# The CLI automatically falls back to that encrypted store if no env vars
# or .env are found, so most people don't need this file at all.
#
# If you still want a plaintext .env for pure CLI-only use (no dashboard),
# copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and fill in your real values.
# ".env" is gitignored -- never commit real credentials. Real OS
# environment variables, if set, always take priority over this file.

OPA_BASE_DOMAIN=yourorg.pam.okta.com
OPA_TEAM_NAME=yourteam-pam
OPA_KEY_ID=
OPA_KEY_SECRET=
